  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【富山・氷見温泉郷】富山湾越しに立山連峰を望む絶景宿6選！名物「氷見寒ブリ」＆白えび三昧</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">雨晴海岸から富山湾越しに浮かび上がる白銀の立山連峰。息をのむ大パノラマを湯船から眺め、富山湾の王者「氷見寒ブリ」や新鮮魚介を堪能する感動の北陸旅へご案内します。</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-6 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/29954/29954.jpg\" alt=\"氷見温泉郷　魚巡りの宿　永芳閣（ＢＢＨホテルグループ）\" class=\"w-full md:w-48 h-36 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1.5\">\n        <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold text-[10px] rounded-full\">特選おすすめ</span>\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-base leading-snug\">氷見温泉郷　魚巡りの宿　永芳閣（ＢＢＨホテルグループ）</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">富山県氷見市阿尾3257 ｜ 【ＪＲ】氷見線　氷見駅から車で１０分（無料送迎あり）/【車】北陸（東海北陸）自動車道⇒能越自動車道　氷見北ＩＣより５分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700 pt-1\">\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">⭐ 4.4（1667件の評価）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">1名目安: ¥8,200〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-amber-50/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-100\">北陸の富山を代表する、お魚処氷見の旅館。評判の魚料理と絶景の露天。海一望の客室。貸切風呂無料プランも</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-2\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D29954\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-4 bg-amber-50/50 rounded-xl border border-amber-200\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xs text-amber-950 mb-2\">📌 あわせて読みたい関連旅行ガイド</h4>\n  <ul class=\"text-xs text-amber-900 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside\">\n    <li><a href=\"/posts/unazuki-kurobe-gorge-trolley-ryokan-guide\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\">宇奈月温泉・黒部峡谷トロッコ電車＆名湯ガイド</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/posts/toyama-onsen-ranking-hotels-guide\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\">富山県の温泉おすすめ旅館＆ホテルランキング10選</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D29954\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n    🛎️ 【公式楽天トラベル】氷見温泉郷　魚巡りの宿　永芳閣（ＢＢＨホテルグループ）の限定クーポン＆空室を見る\n  </a>\n</div>"
